# Tag-based release verification

Releases activate only by pushing tag `v<mod_version>` (see `.github/workflows/curseforge-release.yml`).

Before recommending a release tag, run `bash scripts/verify-release-ready.sh` and ensure:

- `CHANGELOG.md` has `## <mod_version>`
- Working tree clean; tag `v<mod_version>` does not exist yet
- `curseforge_project_id` set; remind about `CURSEFORGE_API_TOKEN` secret

Use `bash scripts/release-tag.sh` then `git push origin v<mod_version>`.
